{
  "message": "I’ve checked the goal and hours: with only the newly joined founder confirmed, narrow the slice. I’ll help you work toward a rough playable test before expanding it. Before approving, reduce the goal and add the three tasks below. At the first sprint review, I’ll look forward to your build, findings and devlog updates ;)",
  "tasks": [],
  "add": [
    "Week 1: Build rough solo sailing around one placeholder island, ending with a downloadable playable build.",
    "Week 2: Add the tide loop and one situation where it changes sailing decisions, ending with an updated playable build.",
    "Weeks 3–4: Test the build with five players and record where sailing and tides work or confuse them, ending with a shareable findings document."
  ],
  "goal": {
    "fit": "narrow",
    "note": "Two islands and co-op put a tested slice at risk within 40–60 hours; this scope mismatch is common and can be corrected now. Use: “A rough playable sailing-and-tide prototype around one island, tested by five players, with their findings recorded.”",
    "stage": {
      "inside": true,
      "note": ""
    }
  }
}

